/ An organiser looking at their own half-finished event gets a way to fill the
/ most conspicuous gap on the page. Everyone else sees nothing at all rather
/ than an empty heading.
- editable = EventPolicy.new(current_member, @event).edit?
- return unless @event.description.present? || editable

section#narrative.py-4
  h3.text-sm.font-semibold.text-stone-500.mb-3 Description

  - if @event.description.present?
    == @event.description
  - else
    = link_to edit_unit_event_path(current_unit, @event),
              class: "inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-paper-600 hover:text-paper-900",
              data: { turbo_frame: "_top" } do
      i.fa-light.fa-plus.fa-fw
      = "Add a description"
